   "source": [
    "## Extracting information from HTML using Beautiful SoupTo extract information the HTML source code of a webpage programmatically, we can use the [Beautiful Soup](https://www.crummy.com/software/BeautifulSoup/bs4/doc/) library. Let's install the library and import the `BeautifulSoup` class from `bs4` module."
