    "### Searching by ClassThe `class` attribute is one of the most frequently used attributes on HTML tags (because it is used for layout and styling). We can search for tags containing a class using the `class_` argument in `find_all` (note that `class` is a reserved keyword in Python, hence the underscore in the argument name).> **QUESTION**: Find all the tags containing the class `HeaderMenu-link`."
