   "source": [
    "The ranges of values in the numerical columns seem reasonable too (no negative ages!), so we may not have to do much data cleaning or correction. The \"charges\" column seems to be significantly skewed however, as the median (50 percentile) is much lower than the maximum value.> **EXERCISE**: What other inferences can you draw by looking at the table above? Add your inferences below:>> 1. ???> 2. ???> 3. ???> 4. ???> 5. ???"
