    "Indeed the line is quite close to the points. It is slightly above the cluster of points, because it's also trying to account for the outliers. > **EXERCISE**: Use the [`SGDRegressor`](https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.linear_model.SGDRegressor.html) class from `scikit-learn` to train a model using the stochastic gradient descent technique. Make predictions and compute the loss. Do you see any difference in the result?"
